  "descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "This repository contains experimental data from radiation tests on an IS61WV204816BLL-10TLI static random access memory by ISSI. This memory is built in 40-nm bulk CMOS tecnology. Some additional data concerning the experiments:\n\n\n\n\nSpecies\nPlace\nDate\nKind of test\n\n\nPositive muons\nISIS neutron & muon source\nDecember, 17-20 2024\nStatic tests at different power supply voltages\nStatic tests at different momentum values\nDynamic tests\n\n\n14-MeV neutrons\nENEA Frascati Research Centre (Italy)\nFebruary, 24-26 2025\nStatic tests at different power supply voltages\n \nDynamic tests\n\n\nNegative muons\nISIS neutron & muon source\nSeptember, 12-13 2025\nStatic tests at different power supply voltages\nStatic tests at different momentum values\nDynamic tests\n\n\n\n\nThe repository contains raw data, treated data and spreadsheets summaryzing the results. Also, the firmware and hardware is included.\n\nThis research was supported in part by the Spanish MICIU project PID2020-112916GB-I00, “RESHYLIENCE” and by the European Union’s 2020 research and innovation program under grant agreement No 101008126, corresponding to the RADNEXT project.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
  ],
